# Clinic

Help clinics manage appointments.

## Entity Appointment: id: ID  status
## Entity Patient: id: ID  name
## Capability bookAppointment (in={'patient': 'Patient'} out=Appointment requires=[])
## Capability confirmAppointment (in={'appointment': 'Appointment'} out= requires=['appointment.confirm'])
## Surface Schedule: presents Appointment[], states ['loading', 'empty', 'populated', 'error']
## Flow BookAppointment: Schedule -> BookAppointment -> BookAppointment -> validating -> validating -> Appointment